  "details": "As a vrchat player, the amount of time you've played the game can mean a lot depending on the rank you are etc.\n\nSo far, the only way to be able to fully count your hours is by running vrchat through steam, meaning that oculus users cannot see the amount of hours they have played for, if they are playing through the oculus application.\n\nI think there should be an indicator on the menu to see how long a certain induvidual has been playing for. \n\ntldr; implement a counter for amount of hours played.",
